Fixed on trunk with r10-5010-g1906392b2c9a02da. Now we reject the code:

g++ pr92082.cc -c -std=c++2a -fconcepts -fchecking
pr92082.cc: In function ‘int main()’:
pr92082.cc:15:61: error: deduced initializer does not satisfy placeholder constraints
   15 |     instanceof<std::map> auto x = std::array<int, 3>{1, 2, 3};
      |                                                             ^
pr92082.cc:15:61: note: constraints not satisfied
pr92082.cc:11:9:   required for the satisfaction of ‘instanceof<std::array<int, 3>, std::map>’
pr92082.cc:11:9: note: the expression ‘resolve<ttp, c>::value’ evaluated to ‘false’
   11 | concept instanceof = resolve<ttp, c>::value;
      |         ^~~~~~~~~~

