	PR c++/98329
	* pt.c (tsubst_copy) <case BIT_CAST_EXPR>: Don't call
	cp_build_bit_cast here, instead just build_min a BIT_CAST_EXPR and set
	its location.
	(tsubst_copy_and_build): Handle BIT_CAST_EXPR.

