We experienced crashes already with GCC 4.8.2, but don't have a small testcase for this, yet.

--- Comment #6 by mpolacek@gcc.gnu.org at 2017-02-23T11:09:25Z ---
Duh, I can reproduce the abort with gcc-5 on my laptop, but not on another machine.

--- Comment #7 by trippels@gcc.gnu.org at 2017-02-23T11:14:33Z ---
Well, the first question is: is this valid C++ code?

--- Comment #8 by mpolacek@gcc.gnu.org at 2017-02-23T11:19:13Z ---
