Looks valid to me.

--- Comment #10 by mpolacek@gcc.gnu.org at 2017-02-23T12:10:53Z ---
Ok, so the Comment 4 testcase started to abort with r217814 and stopped with r229167.

--- Comment #11 by reichelt@gcc.gnu.org at 2017-02-23T12:42:18Z ---
The following testcase returns 1 for me since at least GCC 4.7.
clang (3.2 - 4.0.0rc2), VS (2012, 2015) and ICC all return 0.

============================================================
struct A
{
  char c;
};

int main()
{
  static char A::* p1 = &A::c;
  char A::* const q1 = p1;

  char A::* p2 = &A::c;
  static char A::* const q2 = p2;

