clang still rejects it:

<source>:9:7: error: no viable constructor or deduction guide for deduction of template arguments of 'Y'
      Y{0, Ts{}...};
      ^
<source>:14:3: note: in instantiation of member function 'begin' requested here
  begin(X<int>{});
  ^
